  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan first meets that potential inside Lu Wei Yin’s reforming dream realm, where he holds Virtue true inheritance and its accumulate virtue Gu.",
      "chapters": [
        1542
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_lu_wei_yin",
        "inh_virtue_true_inheritance",
        "gu_accumulate_virtue_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Lu Wei Yin built this dream realm’s Virtue true inheritance himself, a crucial and genuine setup rather than a fiction.",
      "chapters": [
        1543
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "According to that true inheritance, accumulate virtue Gu refines and appears on its own when he does good deeds and acts kindly, and greater kindness raises the rank refined; its greatest stated use is to change his cultivation aptitude into the Righteous Virtue Physique.",
      "chapters": [
        1542
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "When Fang Yuan later receives Southern Border’s Paradise Earth true inheritance in the present day, its human path portion turns out to be that same Virtue true inheritance, with accumulate virtue Gu again named as the core Immortal Gu and the same stated use.",
      "chapters": [
        2087
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "reg_southern_border",
        "inh_paradise_earth_true_inheritance",
        "sys_immortal_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside the dream, the incomplete true inheritance’s vague description calls the Righteous Virtue Physique only inferior to the ten extreme physiques, without any of those physiques’ flaws, representing an unparalleled future and potential.",
      "chapters": [
        1542
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing-versus-ten-extremes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Outside the dream, Southern Border’s Paradise Earth true inheritance repeats the same standing: only inferior to the ten extreme physiques, without their flaws, representing a limitless future and potential.",
      "chapters": [
        2087
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing-versus-ten-extremes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Broader ten extreme rules sit on Ten Extreme Physique.",
      "chapters": [],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "no_citation",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "standing-versus-ten-extremes",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_ten_extreme_physique"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Both descriptions state a change accumulate virtue Gu could produce, not a change either text confirms took place. Of the Paradise Earth portion, the novel states that Fang Yuan had earlier only interacted with a small portion of it in his dream and did not understand its full profundity.",
      "chapters": [
        2087
      ],
